`extensionTabMessaging` leg: real `QTcpServer`-served pages, fixture MV3 extension with `<all_urls>` + content script — round-trip asserted including observed sender shape, plus typed `not-found`, `invalid-argument` (foreign mid), `unsupported` (frameId), `no-host-access` (qrc page). Full suite: **33/33 pass, 0 fail** (2 env-gated Bitwarden skips) under `QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen`.

